    "name_raw": "Coaxing Spell",
    "definition_type_raw": "Metamagic",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Player Companion: Dungeoneer’s Handbook",
    "definition_raw": "Your charms and enchantments reach the minds of even the lowliest dungeon denizens.\n\nPrerequisites: Spell Focus (enchantment), Knowledge (dungeoneering) 6 ranks.\n\nBenefit: This feat only works with mind-affecting effects. A coaxing spell affects mindless oozes and vermin as if they weren’t mindless, but has no effect on other creature types.\n\nLevel Increase: +2 (a coaxing spell uses a spell slot 2 levels higher than the spell’s actual level.)",
